  "body": "For empty-nesters, retirees or downsizers looking to elevate their lifestyle, this is Auckland’s best-kept secret. Welcome to Manly — where life feels like a holiday all year round, with a warm, old-school community spirit and a lifestyle you’ll never want to leave. This is coastal living at its finest — your own slice of paradise.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n- Potential to create space for a boat or campervan\r\n- Stunning kitchen and bathrooms\r\n- Automated Louvre-tech with rain sensors\r\n- Solar heated and saltwater swimming pool\r\n- Polished hardwood floors\r\n- Gas fire providing ducted heating for the home\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned in one of Manly’s most exclusive and tightly held enclaves, this beautifully renovated single-level residence offers effortless luxury and relaxed seaside living, just a short stroll via legal right-of-way to the stunning Big Manly Beach.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully reimagined for both comfort and entertaining, the home features elegant, flexible living spaces that flow seamlessly outdoors. Every detail has been carefully curated to create a refined yet welcoming coastal sanctuary.\r\n\r\nOutside, a sparkling saltwater pool is framed by lush, established landscaping, creating a private, resort-style retreat — perfect for entertaining or unwinding in complete tranquility.\r\n\r\nEnhancing the lifestyle even further is the home’s proximity to an array of local amenities. Enjoy easy access to nearby tennis, bowling, and sailing clubs, while a charming local village just up the road offers a selection of cafés, bakeries, and restaurants, along with essential services including a doctor and pharmacy — everything you need right at your fingertips. In addition to the local amenities, the Whangaparaoa Peninsula and nearby Silverdale provide all the conveniences of modern urban living including shopping centers, big retail and great schools. Access to this outstanding location will only be enhanced in the future by completion of the Penlink Highway which is currently under construction.\r\n\r\nWith convenient right-of-way access to the beach and a vibrant, connected community all around, this is a truly special home that captures the essence of what so many are looking for and what expats return for — lifestyle, belonging, and the feeling of coming home.",
